RustDesk is an open source remote desktop application: control other
computers or let others control yours, through the public RustDesk
servers or a self-hosted server.

This port uses a native egui user interface that mirrors the look of
the official Flutter desktop UI, because the upstream Sciter and Flutter
interfaces are not available on FreeBSD: the main window (own ID and
password, recent/favorite/discovered peers, settings), the remote
desktop window with its toolbar and the connection manager for incoming
connections.
